; Roundabout (issue #377, a King of the Hill stage with a moving hill): four
; platforms in a ring (top, left, right, bottom) and the hill walks round them
; every ~30 s, warning on the next one for the last ~3 s. Two lifts and a pad
; give the way up. (Stage.hill_spots: HillSpot0..3.)
; Rotation (Stage.mode_weights): weighted 4x for King of the Hill, and in any
; other mode dealt into a bag only 30% of the time ("_other").

